[C]Laud [Dm]and [Am]praise [Dm/F]undying.

Verse 3:
[F]Now the [C/E]queen of [Dm]seasons, [F]bright
[Bb]With the day [C]of splendor,
[Bb/D]With [F]the [C]royal [F]feast of feasts,
[C/E]Comes its [Dm]joy [C]to [F]render;
[F]Comes [Gm]to gladden faithful [F]hearts
