[C]Welcome [F]in unwearied strain
[C]Jesus'resurrection.

Verse 4:
[F]For today [C/E]among the [F]twelve
[Bb]Christ appeared, [C]be stowing
[Bb/D]His deep [F]peace, [C]which [F]evermore
[C/E]Passes [Dm]human [F]knowing.
[F]Neither [Gm]could the [Am]gates [Gm/Bb]of [F]death,
