Verse 5:
[F]"Alleluia!" [C/E]now [Dm]we [C]cry
[Bb]To our King [C]immortal,
[Bb/D]Who, [F]triumphant, burst the bars
[C/E]Of the [Dm]tomb's [C]dark [F]portal;
